## Working on it

All work runs through the `{{SLUG}}-pipeline` Claude Code skill (see `CLAUDE.md`). To start a session, open this
folder and run:

```
claude --agent pipeline-lead --effort high
```

then say **"what's next on {{PROJECT_NAME}}?"**

## The harness on a new machine

The harness (skills, agents, guard hooks) is a Claude Code plugin inside this repo. Install it once per machine, from
that machine's clone:

```
claude plugin marketplace add <path to this clone>
claude plugin install {{SLUG}}@{{SLUG}}-local
node .claude/hooks/harness-check.mjs
```

The last line should end `Result: ok`. Updates arrive with `git pull`. Details: `docs/harness-plugin.md`.

